\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.5}{\ignorespaces Training with remote teacher logits. Offline caches are uploaded to R2, fetched lazily during training and kept in a bounded local cache with oldest-file eviction. This setup avoids copying a multi-terabyte teacher store onto each rented GPU instance.\relax }}{46}{figure.caption.42}%
